{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34433","headline":"和袭美新秋即事次韵三首 三 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美新秋即事次韵三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"声利从来解破除，秋滩唯忆下桐庐。\n鸬鷀阵合残阳少，蜻蛚吟高冷雨疎。\n辩伏南华论指指，才非玄晏借书书。\n当时任使真堪笑，波上三年学炙鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}